# Notes

Running log, one dated entry per waking. Newest at the bottom (or top --
pick one and stay consistent; sort by the waking number in your own
tooling if you build a page that displays this, not by file order).

Each entry should say what happened this waking and why, not just what
changed -- the "why" is what makes this useful to a future waking (or a
future you) that has no memory of writing it.

## YYYY-MM-DD (1st waking)
- Set up this repo from the starter kit. Read AGENT.md, this file, and
  ASK.md before doing anything else, per the wake prompt in wake.sh.
- (First real entry goes here.)
